QuestGuidance.Register("es",387,{
[12353]="70015E42\n1\tDerrota dunlendinos al sureste de Gwingris (total: 12)\tLos dunlendinos se pueden encontrar al sureste de Gwingris. Inufileg te ha pedido que derrotes a los dunlendinos que están devastando el bosque de Sâd Rechu.\n2\tHabla con Inufileg en Gwingris\tInufileg se encuentra en Gwingris, al noroeste del campamento de los dunlendinos. Debes informar a Inufileg sobre tu éxito contra los dunlendinos.\n",
[12354]="7004DA75\n1\tClean up splotches of mud in the guards' barracks (total: 10)\tMud can be found throughout the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should clean up splotches of mud left by uncleanly guards in the guard's barracks.\n2\tTalk to Álarr\tCaptain Álarr can be found in the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should talk to Álarr.\n",
[12355]="70062217\n1\tEncuentra a la saga del Bosque Viejo\tRhiangar te ha pedido que busques a la saga del Bosque Viejo. El bosque Viejo está en el noroeste de Cardolan.\n2\tCaptura peces (total: 5)\tHenbran te ha pedido que le lleves el pez del río. El río está cerca de Sarch Vorn, cerca del Bosque Viejo.\n3\tLleva el pez a Henbran\tDeberías llevarle el pez que has pescado a Henbran Amon. Henbran está en el Bosque Viejo, en el noroeste de Cardolan.\n",
[12356]="70021AD8\n1\tDerrota a los semi-orcos (total: 12)\030Derrota a Bûzog\tHay semi-orcos por todo Nan Laeglin, especialmente en las granjas de los uch-lûth que han asaltado. Siorus Brehur te ha pedido que expulses de Nan Laeglin a los asaltantes semi-orcos y a su líder, Bûzog.\n2\tHabla con Siorus Brehur en el salón del Brenin\tSiorus Brehur está en el salón del Brenin, en el pueblo de Nan Laeglin. Debes volver cuanto antes a ver a Siorus Brehur con las noticias de tu éxito.\n",
[12357]="7002512E\n1\tDerrota a los semi-orcos (total: 12)\tPueden encontrarse semi-orcos por todo Nan Laeglin, especialmente por la zona donde han asaltado las granjas Uch-lûth. Siorus Brehur te ha pedido que expulses a los asaltantes semi-orcos de las granjas de su gente.\n2\tHabla con Siorus Brehur en el salón del Brenin\tSiorus Brehur está en el salón del Brenin, en el pueblo de Nan Laeglin. Debes volver cuanto antes a ver a Siorus Brehur con las noticias de tu éxito.\n",
[12358]="70015E3F\n1\tDerrota a los cuidadores de lobos semi-orcos en Barad Morlas (total: 5)\tLos cuidadores de lobos semi-orcos pueden encontrarse patrullando Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion. Dornhador te ha pedido que derrotes a los cuidadores de lobos semi-orcos en Barad Morlas para ayudar a desbaratar sus planes.\n2\tHabla con Dornhador en Echad Eregion\tDornhador está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas. Deberías volver a ver a Dornhador con las noticias de tu victoria.\n",
[12359]="7005A64D\n1\tTalk to Zóva in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should talk to Zóva in Vérnozal.\n2\tHail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should hail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal.\n",
[12360]="7005FE53\n1\tTalk to Zóva in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should talk to Zóva in Vérnozal.\n2\tHail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal\tThe hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset. You should hail Prince Ingór in Vérnozal.\n",
[12361]="70054686\n1\tWhistle while near the Halls of Black Lore\tFaeron has asked for you to search for the Halls of Black Lore. They are somewhere in the Circle of Madness in Minas Morgul. You should find the Halls and then signal the Rangers by whistling.\n2\tHabla con Faeron\tFaeron and the rest of the Rangers have moved to the Halls of Black Lore. You should talk to Faeron.\n3\tSpeak to Rhadrog to complete 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'\tThe time has come to enter the Halls of Black Lore. Speak to Rhadrog near the Halls to begin 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'.\n4\tHabla con Rhadrog\tRhadrog has returned to Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[12362]="70021AD7\n1\tHabla con el campeón del emisario en la Sala del Brenin\tEl campeón del emisario se encuentra en la Sala del Brenin, en Lhanuch. Debes hablar con el campeón del emisario.\n",
[12363]="70045E89\n1\tTalk to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing\tAragorn is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Aragorn and assist him with healing the wounded\tAragorn is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing\tGandalf is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n",
[12364]="70042EAF\n1\tDefeat mûmakil in Southern Ithilien (total: 4)\tMûmakil can be found near enemy encampments in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat mûmakil in Southern Ithilien.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated mûmakil in Southern Ithilien.\n",
[12365]="700430D9\n1\tDefeat Morgul defilers\tMorgul defilers can be found in the Harlond, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should defeat the Morgul defilers in the Harlond to protect Lossarnach from their poisonous devilry.\n2\tDefeat Morgul defilers (total: 5)\tMorgul defilers can be found in the Harlond, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should defeat the Morgul defilers in the Harlond to protect Lossarnach from their poisonous devilry.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated the Morgul defilers at the Harlond.\n",
[12366]="700430DF\n1\tDefeat Orc look-outs\tOrc look-outs are perched at many high spots around the Harlond, especially near the entrance, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should dispatch a good number of Orc look-outs.\n2\tDefeat Orc look-outs (total: 6)\tOrc look-outs are perched at many high spots around the Harlond, especially near the entrance, in the northmost part of Lossarnach. You should dispatch a good number of Orc look-outs.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated the Orc look-outs at the Harlond.\n",
[12367]="70043059\n1\tDestroy the siege weapons\tThe siege weapons can be found before the Rammas Echor's southern gate, at the northmost edge of Lossarnach. You should break the Orcs' siege weapons in order to hobble, or at least slow down, their ability to do harm.\n2\tDestroy Orc trebuchets (total: 2)\030Destroy Orc ballistae (total: 3)\tThe siege weapons can be found before the Rammas Echor's southern gate, at the northmost edge of Lossarnach. You should break the Orcs' siege weapons in order to hobble, or at least slow down, their ability to do harm.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have destroyed the Orkish siege equipment at the Harlond.\n",
[12368]="7004D6FF\n1\tHithlos's vase, goblet, box, and harp can be found in Felegoth. You should seek out Hithlos's lost items.\t\n2\tBring the items you found to Hithlos\tHithlos can be found in Felegoth. You should bring the items you found to Hithlos.\n3\tRecoge flores (total: 7)\tFlowers can be found in the gardens of Felegoth. You should pick flowers for Hithlos's vase.\n4\tPut the flowers in Hithlos's vase\tHithlos's vase can be found beside him in Felegoth. You should put the flowers in the vase for Hithlos.\n5\tTalk to Hithlos\tHithlos can be found in Felegoth. You should talk to Hithlos.\n",
[12369]="70054F50\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12370]="70054F5A\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12371]="70054F55\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12372]="70054F52\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol has a plan.\n2\tDestroy the first barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it.\n3\tDestroy the second barricade\tDolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.\n4\tFind and defeat Shaktur\tYou should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.\n5\tDefeat Dargásh\tYou should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.\n",
[12373]="70022712\n1\tHabla con Lobelia dentro del Agujero Embrujado\tLobelia ha bajado al Agujero Embrujado para investigar, cuya puerta se encuentra en el Árbol de la Fiesta, debajo de Bolsón Cerrado. Deberías unirte a Lobelia en el Agujero Embrujado.\n2\tHabla con Opal Buenavista para discutir el destino del Agujero Embrujado\tOpal Buenavista está en el Árbol de la Fiesta en Hobbiton. Deberías hablar con Opal Buenavista para entender lo que acaba de suceder.\n",
[12374]="70021E80\n1\tEncuentra a Daervunn en la Arboleda Lóbrega.\tEncuentra al montaraz Daervunn, quien se ha adentrado en los confines norte de la Arboleda Lóbrega. No es seguro que siga con vida, pero, de ser así, es posible que haya encontrado un camino hacia las Tierras Brunas que no esté vigilado por el enemigo.\n",
[12375]="70072EFF\n1\tExamine the banner by the entrance to the Haven of Bâkhridar\tStanding by the entrance to the Haven of Bâkhridar, you consider what can be done to oppose the threat of those who dwell here.\n2\tExplore the Heirsworn tents in the north-west corner of the Haven\030Explore the Heirsworn tents in the south-west corner of the Haven\030Explore the Heirsworn tents on the central rise of the Haven\tYou should explore the various corners of the Haven of Bâkhridar and learn the mood of those who dwell here.\n3\tCompletado\tThe longer the Heirsworn Corsairs remain at the Haven of Bâkhridar, the more their complaints grow.\n",
[12376]="7004E4EC\n1\tDefeat Boskhín Wolfseye\030Defeat Vulkhós\030Defeat Iltish\tThe Jangovar are attacking Hammerstead! You should defeat the Jangovar leaders.\n2\tTalk to Lóssi\tYou should talk to Lóssi, who can be found defending Hammerstead.\n",
[12377]="70041868\n1\tThama Aklam can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed. Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat the leader of the Haradrim in Thama Aklam.\t\n2\tTalk to Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed. You have defeated the leader of the Haradrim in Thama Aklam, and should now return to Steward Malthellim.\n",
[12378]="700659CB\n1\tTalk to Nanthel\tMaldor has asked you to speak with a healer in Linhir regarding Berion. Talk to Nanthel in Linhir.\n",
[12379]="700460AE\n1\tAttend to patients (total: 8)\tThe Houses of Healing can be found in the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Go to the High Hall, House of Remedies, or House of Rest and tend to patients.\n2\tReturn to Ioreth\tIoreth can be found in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should let Ioreth know that you have treated many patients, although there were some possessed of a strange ailment you were unable to treat.\n",
[12380]="7003FF22\n1\tSecure swans (total: 6)\tThe swans are revered by the people of Dol Amroth.\n",
[12381]="7005293A\n1\tDefend Laerlad from the approaching invaders\tBlómgard can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin. You must defend Laerlad from the approaching invaders!\n2\tDefend Laerlad from the spider invaders\030Defeat the strange spiders (total: 2)\tBlómgard can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin. You must defend Laerlad from the spider invaders.\n3\tTalk to Odahild\tOdahild can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Odahild.\n4\tTalk to the wounded Ungoladan warrior\tThe wounded Ungoladan warrior can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to the Ungoladan and learn what you can.\n5\tHabla con Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[12382]="70062C9D\n1\tEncuentra el pañuelo perdido de Adan Rhuvyg\tAdan Rhuvyg te ha pedido que encuentres su pañuelo perdido. El pañuelo fue arrastrado por el viento al noroeste de Lintrev.\n2\tLleva el pañuelo a Adan Rhuvyg\tDeberías llevar el pañuelo a Adan. Adan está en Lintrev.\n",
[12383]="70062CA1\n1\tHabla con Adan junto a los acantilados\tAdan Rhuvyg te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en lo alto de los acantilados cercanos. Los acantilados están al norte del pueblo de Lintrev.\n2\tMira los Valles de los Fuertes\030Encuentra un buen punto de observación\tAdan Rhuvyg ha sugerido que disfrutes de la vista desde los acantilados de Lintrev.\n3\tCuéntale a Adan lo que viste\tDeberías hablar con Adan sobre la vista. Adan está en lo alto de los acantilados de Lintrev.\n4\tRecolecta la tela de la cometa\030Recolecta un carrete de cuerda\030Recolecta una rama caída\tAdan te ha pedido que encuentres materiales con los que fabricar una cometa. Los materiales de la cometa pueden encontrarse por todo Lintrev.\n5\tLleva los materiales de la cometa a Adan\tDeberías llevar los materiales de la cometa a Adan. Adan se encuentra en Lintrev.\n",
[12384]="70066EB6\n1\tTalk to Bregon in Sardol\tBregon can be found at Sardol in the Blackroot Vale. Amathon has asked you to speak with Bregon, a seemingly-reformed freebooter from the Blackroot Vale, and learn if he knows what the Corsairs have planned in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tFollow the road through Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should follow the road into Tarlang's Crown and begin your search for them.\n3\tExamine the damaged barricade\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found a damaged barricade on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n4\tFollow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. Bregon has informed you that the Corsairs of Umbar have returned to Tarlang's Crown. You should continue to follow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown.\n5\tExamine the abandoned encampment\tThe abandoned encampment can be found in Tarlang's Crown. You have found a small encampment abandoned by the Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n6\tFollow the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tTarlang's Crown can be found by following the road south from Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found a small abandoned encampment on the road through Tarlang's Crown. You should examine it.\n7\tFind Azruthor's tent and search for any evidence of a new plot against Gondor\tAzruthor's tent can be found in Azruthor's Rue in Tarlang's Crown. Although Azruthor's encampment was left in ruins, the Corsairs of Umbar have taken up in it. You should search for Azruthor's tent.\n8\tTalk to Amathon in Sardol\tAmathon can be found in Sardol, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found no sign that the Corsairs of Umbar seek to do anything but pillage the remains of Azruthor's encampment in Tarlang's Crown. You should return to Amathon.\n",
})
